  "label": "The Eiffel Tower is mapped as a symbol of Paris under threat",
  "description": "The Eiffel Tower, as a prominent visual element in the Paris cityscape, is implicitly mapped to represent the city of Paris itself, which is the target of the ISIS attack. The text references the attack in Paris, and the visual of the Eiffel Tower serves as a symbolic anchor for the location and the trauma described in the text.",
